Hakkillo adds project code, synthetic training examples, and LoRA
adaptation of the base model's attention query and value projections.
It is not a model pretrained from scratch and is not endorsed by Hugging Face.

The v0.2 writing candidate adds a separate experimental adapter trained on
synthetic grammar and polite-rewriting requests, plus evaluation reports.
